1
00:01:38,650 --> 00:01:43,039
[Shadow Punisher]

2
00:01:43,090 --> 00:01:43,720
[Divine Constable Tally]

3
00:01:43,720 --> 00:01:45,870
[Episode 13]

4
00:01:46,759 --> 00:01:48,200
Don't run! Stop!

5
00:01:49,640 --> 00:01:50,509
Got you now!

6
00:01:53,759 --> 00:01:54,560
Get her!

7
00:01:59,229 --> 00:02:00,040
Stop!

8
00:02:01,710 --> 00:02:02,510
My Lords.

9
00:02:02,510 --> 00:02:03,710
This girl ran away from the mansion.

10
00:02:03,710 --> 00:02:04,710
We are teaching her a lesson

11
00:02:04,710 --> 00:02:05,640
on behalf of our Master.

12
00:02:05,640 --> 00:02:06,700
We won't bother...

13
00:02:07,840 --> 00:02:09,000
So many of you

14
00:02:09,520 --> 00:02:10,960
beating a child.

15
00:02:11,000 --> 00:02:12,310
Have you no shame?

16
00:02:18,310 --> 00:02:19,120
Jiuying.

17
00:02:19,960 --> 00:02:20,910
Don't be afraid.

18
00:02:21,520 --> 00:02:22,960
I won't hurt you.

19
00:02:25,000 --> 00:02:26,190
If you want,

20
00:02:26,190 --> 00:02:27,560
come back with us.

21
00:02:37,240 --> 00:02:38,030
Watch out.

22
00:02:54,310 --> 00:02:55,120
There it is!

23
00:02:59,710 --> 00:03:00,460
Run!

24
00:03:00,480 --> 00:03:01,710
Oh my goodness.

25
00:03:01,840 --> 00:03:03,750
This must be the real green-haired demon.

26
00:03:03,750 --> 00:03:06,150
There really is a demon
in Mingling County.

27
00:03:12,240 --> 00:03:13,030
After them!

28
00:03:28,000 --> 00:03:29,710
If what the note says is true

29
00:03:30,030 --> 00:03:31,840
and Gong Sihai is selling government salt,

30
00:03:31,840 --> 00:03:33,630
I'm afraid the waters in Mingling County

31
00:03:33,630 --> 00:03:35,430
are much deeper than we thought.

32
00:04:04,240 --> 00:04:05,030
This is...

33
00:04:06,960 --> 00:04:07,900
A Chiying bug.

34
00:04:45,159 --> 00:04:47,510
I've searched high and low for this.

35
00:04:48,310 --> 00:04:49,000
I didn't expect

36
00:04:49,000 --> 00:04:50,560
to find it here.

37
00:04:52,630 --> 00:04:54,360
No wonder it's called Chiying.

38
00:04:54,830 --> 00:04:55,630
It must be

39
00:04:56,190 --> 00:04:57,190
named after

40
00:04:57,190 --> 00:04:58,600
its glowing wings.

41
00:05:00,600 --> 00:05:02,040
This tiny bug

42
00:05:02,600 --> 00:05:04,860
can actually mutate people into demons.

43
00:05:05,160 --> 00:05:06,360
Could the Gong family

44
00:05:06,800 --> 00:05:09,000
also be related to the Liluo Dark Night?

45
00:05:09,040 --> 00:05:10,360
Old Geezer said that

46
00:05:10,630 --> 00:05:11,750
these Chiying bugs

47
00:05:12,000 --> 00:05:14,600
love to gather around graves.

48
00:05:16,160 --> 00:05:17,890
Could it be that in this lake...

49
00:05:18,040 --> 00:05:19,500
Let's go down and find out.

50
00:05:27,720 --> 00:05:29,650
It's Zhenzhu, Yan, and the others.

51
00:05:31,040 --> 00:05:32,440
Let's go help them first.

52
00:05:32,560 --> 00:05:33,830
Anyway, a lake this big

53
00:05:34,040 --> 00:05:35,440
won't run away on its own.

54
00:05:46,720 --> 00:05:47,510
Yan.

55
00:05:48,830 --> 00:05:49,720
What happened?

56
00:05:49,720 --> 00:05:50,600
Let me tell you.

57
00:05:50,950 --> 00:05:52,750
My eyes were really opened today.

58
00:05:52,750 --> 00:05:54,040
There really is a green-haired demon.

59
00:05:54,040 --> 00:05:55,950
It was covered in green hair.

60
00:05:56,159 --> 00:05:57,430
It looked like a wolf,

61
00:05:57,430 --> 00:05:58,200
but for some reason,

62
00:05:58,200 --> 00:05:58,920
it became demonic.

63
00:05:58,920 --> 00:05:59,560
What?

64
00:05:59,560 --> 00:06:00,830
Yan isn't exaggerating.

65
00:06:00,830 --> 00:06:01,690
We originally wanted

66
00:06:01,690 --> 00:06:02,630
to save Xia Jiuying,

67
00:06:02,630 --> 00:06:03,790
but a wolf appeared all of a sudden

68
00:06:03,790 --> 00:06:04,990
and carried her away.

69
00:06:05,120 --> 00:06:06,040
Although it's a wolf,

70
00:06:06,040 --> 00:06:07,720
its body has completely mutated.

71
00:06:07,720 --> 00:06:09,390
It doesn't look like
a normal animal at all.

72
00:06:09,390 --> 00:06:10,790
Where is the mutated wolf

73
00:06:11,630 --> 00:06:12,510
now?

74
00:06:13,310 --> 00:06:14,120
How can two legs

75
00:06:14,120 --> 00:06:15,430
outrun four paws?

76
00:06:15,430 --> 00:06:16,630
We couldn't catch up.

77
00:06:17,120 --> 00:06:18,310
It also snatched

78
00:06:18,310 --> 00:06:19,510
Huang Bingshui away.

79
00:06:19,830 --> 00:06:20,630
Speak.

80
00:06:21,120 --> 00:06:21,920
I'll speak!

81
00:06:22,630 --> 00:06:23,310
We were

82
00:06:23,310 --> 00:06:24,630
running ahead.

83
00:06:24,630 --> 00:06:26,040
Then we heard a scream

84
00:06:26,040 --> 00:06:27,380
and saw Huang Bingshui

85
00:06:27,400 --> 00:06:28,950
being carried away by that demon wolf.

86
00:06:28,950 --> 00:06:29,750
Was he eaten?

87
00:06:30,160 --> 00:06:31,430
We didn't dare to look.

88
00:06:32,390 --> 00:06:33,340
Only drip-shaped bloodstains

89
00:06:33,340 --> 00:06:34,670
were found at the scene.

90
00:06:34,720 --> 00:06:35,630
Judging from this,

91
00:06:35,630 --> 00:06:36,740
he must have been bitten

92
00:06:36,740 --> 00:06:37,430
and taken away.

93
00:06:37,430 --> 00:06:38,190
Strange.

94
00:06:39,130 --> 00:06:41,000
Why did it take Huang Bingshui away?

95
00:06:41,000 --> 00:06:41,800
It must be...

96
00:06:41,950 --> 00:06:43,190
It must be Xia Jiuying

97
00:06:43,190 --> 00:06:44,570
who made that monster do it.

98
00:06:44,570 --> 00:06:45,800
Huang Bingshui

99
00:06:45,820 --> 00:06:47,060
often beat that girl.

100
00:06:47,240 --> 00:06:48,159
Tell me,

101
00:06:48,720 --> 00:06:49,540
how did Zhe Shan

102
00:06:49,540 --> 00:06:50,700
treat Xia Jiuying?

103
00:06:50,790 --> 00:06:53,159
He always beat and scolded her.

104
00:06:57,630 --> 00:06:58,430
Zhenzhu,

105
00:06:58,830 --> 00:06:59,890
do you suspect that

106
00:07:00,430 --> 00:07:02,310
Xia Jiuying ordered the demon wolf

107
00:07:02,310 --> 00:07:03,710
to maul Zhe Shan to death?

108
00:07:05,950 --> 00:07:06,830
I think

109
00:07:07,040 --> 00:07:08,390
it's really possible.

110
00:07:09,040 --> 00:07:11,800
A green-haired demon
appeared in Mingling County.

111
00:07:11,800 --> 00:07:13,360
Under Xia Jiuying's orders,

112
00:07:13,360 --> 00:07:15,390
it mauled the boxer Zhe Shan to death,

113
00:07:15,390 --> 00:07:16,430
carried the body

114
00:07:16,430 --> 00:07:17,800
into Mount Fuyao,

115
00:07:17,830 --> 00:07:19,490
and dumped it in the Yan River.

116
00:07:19,800 --> 00:07:20,720
It all adds up.

117
00:07:24,510 --> 00:07:25,310
Anyway,

118
00:07:26,000 --> 00:07:27,280
let's find him first.

119
00:07:27,300 --> 00:07:28,190
Are they leaving us here?

120
00:07:28,190 --> 00:07:29,520
Mount Fuyao is this way.

121
00:07:32,870 --> 00:07:33,560
My Lords!

122
00:07:33,560 --> 00:07:33,920
My Lords!

123
00:07:33,920 --> 00:07:35,620
-My Lords, please let us go.
-My Lord, please let me down!

124
00:07:35,620 --> 00:07:36,820
-My Lords!
-My Lords!

125
00:07:50,560 --> 00:07:51,360
My Lord,

126
00:07:51,360 --> 00:07:52,510
we found nothing.

127
00:07:58,310 --> 00:07:59,240
My Lords,

128
00:08:00,600 --> 00:08:02,000
Mount Fuyao is huge.

129
00:08:02,630 --> 00:08:04,430
We've been searching all night.

130
00:08:04,720 --> 00:08:06,720
Are you sure it's in this direction?

131
00:08:08,800 --> 00:08:10,950
Huang Bingshui was injured last night.

132
00:08:10,950 --> 00:08:12,360
The wound should have clotted by now.

133
00:08:12,360 --> 00:08:14,920
Would there still be
bloodstains on the ground?

134
00:08:14,920 --> 00:08:16,040
Blood can clot,

135
00:08:16,390 --> 00:08:17,560
but the smell won't.

136
00:08:24,160 --> 00:08:25,720
Found him! Found him!

137
00:08:31,190 --> 00:08:32,929
Found him! He's here!

138
00:08:33,440 --> 00:08:34,600
Help!

139
00:08:34,870 --> 00:08:35,360
Here!

140
00:08:35,360 --> 00:08:36,440
Help!

141
00:08:38,150 --> 00:08:39,600
My Lord! My Lord!

142
00:08:39,600 --> 00:08:40,390
Save me...

143
00:08:40,840 --> 00:08:41,630
Save me!

144
00:08:43,150 --> 00:08:44,030
Save me...

145
00:08:45,030 --> 00:08:45,790
This bite mark

146
00:08:45,790 --> 00:08:47,050
matches the one on Zhe Shan's throat

147
00:08:47,050 --> 00:08:47,860
perfectly.

148
00:08:48,120 --> 00:08:49,150
What did I tell you?

149
00:08:49,150 --> 00:08:50,650
It must be that girl seeking revenge

150
00:08:50,650 --> 00:08:51,600
by setting the wolf on him.

151
00:08:51,600 --> 00:08:52,390
No.

152
00:08:52,790 --> 00:08:54,440
If it was for revenge,

153
00:08:54,440 --> 00:08:55,960
why didn't he die instantly

154
00:08:55,960 --> 00:08:57,030
with a crushed throat like Zhe Shan?

155
00:08:57,030 --> 00:08:57,960
My Lord, save me.

156
00:08:58,150 --> 00:08:59,030
Just save me,

157
00:08:59,360 --> 00:09:00,790
and I'll tell you everything.

158
00:09:00,790 --> 00:09:01,840
Ji Ada did it all.

159
00:09:01,840 --> 00:09:03,030
Ji Ada did it all!

160
00:09:03,030 --> 00:09:04,320
I was forced into it!

161
00:09:05,720 --> 00:09:06,840
Stop dawdling.

162
00:09:07,120 --> 00:09:07,910
Spit it out.

163
00:09:08,200 --> 00:09:09,840
I'll tell you everything.

164
00:09:10,750 --> 00:09:11,750
Twelve years ago,

165
00:09:12,600 --> 00:09:14,120
Ji Ada took a few of us

166
00:09:14,600 --> 00:09:16,400
up the mountains to hunt wolves.

167
00:09:17,790 --> 00:09:19,650
We ran into Xia Jiuying's mother.

168
00:09:21,000 --> 00:09:23,000
Seeing that she was somewhat pretty,

169
00:09:23,000 --> 00:09:24,510
he harbored lecherous thoughts.

170
00:09:24,510 --> 00:09:26,320
But she resisted aggressively

171
00:09:27,200 --> 00:09:28,720
and even bit Ji Ada.

172
00:09:29,000 --> 00:09:30,030
In a fit of anger,

173
00:09:30,750 --> 00:09:32,240
he ordered me to release the dogs.

174
00:09:32,240 --> 00:09:33,720
Those were hunting dogs.

175
00:09:34,120 --> 00:09:35,360
They were very fierce.

176
00:09:35,360 --> 00:09:37,240
About 4 or 5 of them surrounded the woman

177
00:09:37,240 --> 00:09:38,600
and bit her to death.

178
00:09:38,600 --> 00:09:39,270
What?

179
00:09:40,240 --> 00:09:41,440
So Xia Jiuying's mother

180
00:09:41,440 --> 00:09:42,840
wasn't killed by wolves.

181
00:09:42,880 --> 00:09:44,030
She was killed by you

182
00:09:44,030 --> 00:09:44,600
animals!

183
00:09:44,600 --> 00:09:45,790
No, it wasn't me!

184
00:09:45,790 --> 00:09:46,510
Divine Constable,

185
00:09:46,510 --> 00:09:48,000
Ji Ada made me do it.

186
00:09:48,000 --> 00:09:49,240
I had no choice.

187
00:09:55,120 --> 00:09:56,050
Does Xia Jiuying

188
00:09:56,630 --> 00:09:58,030
know about this?

189
00:09:59,120 --> 00:09:59,910
No.

190
00:10:01,120 --> 00:10:02,320
Once out of the woods,

191
00:10:02,840 --> 00:10:04,570
no one ever mentioned it again.

192
00:10:04,630 --> 00:10:05,830
Ji Ada put out the word

193
00:10:06,120 --> 00:10:06,960
that the woman

194
00:10:07,790 --> 00:10:09,120
was mauled by wolves.

195
00:10:09,750 --> 00:10:11,120
If anyone let it slip,

196
00:10:12,030 --> 00:10:13,490
he'd cut their tongue out.

197
00:10:13,550 --> 00:10:14,840
But Ji Ada said

198
00:10:15,440 --> 00:10:16,840
he was the one who collected

199
00:10:16,840 --> 00:10:17,840
her mother's body.

200
00:10:17,840 --> 00:10:18,720
Bah!

201
00:10:20,200 --> 00:10:21,320
Killing someone

202
00:10:21,510 --> 00:10:23,040
and burying them on the spot

203
00:10:23,390 --> 00:10:25,150
is hardly considered collecting a body.

204
00:10:25,150 --> 00:10:25,840
I still remember

205
00:10:25,840 --> 00:10:27,040
where she was buried.

206
00:10:27,840 --> 00:10:29,700
It's just a little further ahead.

207
00:10:30,840 --> 00:10:32,000
I can take you there.

208
00:10:32,430 --> 00:10:33,440
But now,

209
00:10:34,000 --> 00:10:35,600
there's nothing left there.

210
00:10:35,750 --> 00:10:36,630
I've already given

211
00:10:36,630 --> 00:10:37,910
the last skull

212
00:10:38,440 --> 00:10:39,720
to Xia Jiuying.

213
00:10:40,720 --> 00:10:42,360
She kept you alive

214
00:10:43,200 --> 00:10:44,840
just so you could point out

215
00:10:44,840 --> 00:10:46,030
the burial spot?

216
00:10:47,630 --> 00:10:48,440
Yes.

217
00:10:51,630 --> 00:10:52,960
Xia Jiuying has been
looking for her mother

218
00:10:52,960 --> 00:10:53,960
for so many years.

219
00:10:54,000 --> 00:10:54,890
Didn't she

220
00:10:54,920 --> 00:10:56,200
ask you before?

221
00:10:56,440 --> 00:10:57,790
Of course she did.

222
00:10:58,510 --> 00:10:59,510
But who would

223
00:11:00,320 --> 00:11:01,320
dare to tell her?

224
00:11:02,000 --> 00:11:03,630
Later, Xia Jiuying grew up

225
00:11:03,910 --> 00:11:04,750
to be foolish

226
00:11:04,750 --> 00:11:06,080
but skilled at hunting.

227
00:11:06,750 --> 00:11:08,550
So Ji Ada took an interest in her.

228
00:11:08,720 --> 00:11:09,600
Ji Ada

229
00:11:10,240 --> 00:11:11,000
came up with a

230
00:11:11,000 --> 00:11:12,320
wicked idea to use the dead

231
00:11:12,320 --> 00:11:13,580
to control the living.

232
00:11:13,600 --> 00:11:14,800
Every once in a while,

233
00:11:15,320 --> 00:11:17,450
he would dig up a bone and toss it to her.

234
00:11:18,200 --> 00:11:18,920
To get

235
00:11:18,950 --> 00:11:20,390
her mother's bones,

236
00:11:21,510 --> 00:11:23,240
Xia Jiuying had to work for him.

237
00:11:23,440 --> 00:11:24,550
After 5 years,

238
00:11:25,200 --> 00:11:26,390
the whole skeleton

239
00:11:27,200 --> 00:11:29,000
is now only missing a skull.

240
00:11:29,000 --> 00:11:30,200
A bunch of animals!

241
00:11:31,200 --> 00:11:32,150
Now tell me.

242
00:11:32,670 --> 00:11:33,540
When the dogs were released

243
00:11:33,540 --> 00:11:35,670
to maul Xia Jiuying's mother to death,

244
00:11:35,720 --> 00:11:36,790
was Zhe Shan there?

245
00:11:37,480 --> 00:11:38,270
Yes.

246
00:11:38,630 --> 00:11:40,360
Yes, he was there too!

247
00:11:40,750 --> 00:11:42,510
He was leading one of the dogs.

248
00:11:42,840 --> 00:11:44,390
You used the bones of a loved one

249
00:11:44,390 --> 00:11:46,000
to threaten a child!

250
00:11:46,440 --> 00:11:47,670
You're all worse than animals!

251
00:11:47,670 --> 00:11:48,480
My Lords,

252
00:11:49,240 --> 00:11:50,720
please have mercy!

253
00:11:50,960 --> 00:11:52,120
Please have mercy.

254
00:11:53,000 --> 00:11:55,200
For the sake of me helping Xia Jiuying

255
00:11:55,390 --> 00:11:56,550
find her mother,

256
00:11:56,840 --> 00:11:57,910
please spare me.

257
00:11:58,200 --> 00:11:59,150
Just now,

258
00:12:00,000 --> 00:12:01,440
I dug up that skull

259
00:12:01,720 --> 00:12:03,150
and gave it to her.

260
00:12:03,910 --> 00:12:05,200
Please spare me.

261
00:12:05,630 --> 00:12:07,240
Let me go, My Lord.

262
00:12:07,440 --> 00:12:09,000
My Lord, My Lord.

263
00:12:09,000 --> 00:12:10,030
My Lord, My Lord.

264
00:12:12,390 --> 00:12:13,320
Please spare me.

265
00:12:14,030 --> 00:12:15,690
My Lords, you don't know this,

266
00:12:15,840 --> 00:12:16,840
but that Hound Pit

267
00:12:17,840 --> 00:12:19,040
hides other secrets.

268
00:12:20,360 --> 00:12:21,750
If you spare me,

269
00:12:22,630 --> 00:12:24,320
I will confess everything.

270
00:12:25,150 --> 00:12:26,720
I will confess everything!

271
00:12:27,550 --> 00:12:28,950
My Lord, please spare me.

272
00:12:29,030 --> 00:12:29,960
Please spare me!

273
00:12:36,110 --> 00:12:37,060
Lord Situ.

274
00:12:38,960 --> 00:12:40,000
Please

275
00:12:40,750 --> 00:12:42,680
escort this man back to the county office

276
00:12:42,680 --> 00:12:44,000
for overnight interrogation.

277
00:12:44,000 --> 00:12:45,000
Leave the rest

278
00:12:45,510 --> 00:12:46,550
to us.

279
00:12:46,840 --> 00:12:47,630
Yes.

280
00:12:48,150 --> 00:12:48,840
Take him away.

281
00:12:48,840 --> 00:12:49,640
Take him away.

282
00:12:50,600 --> 00:12:51,660
Please spare me...

283
00:12:52,720 --> 00:12:53,510
My Lord!

284
00:12:54,360 --> 00:12:55,150
Move!

285
00:12:56,840 --> 00:12:57,960
I didn't expect

286
00:12:58,440 --> 00:13:00,840
this child to have such a hard life.

287
00:13:03,840 --> 00:13:05,000
If Xia Jiuying

288
00:13:05,000 --> 00:13:06,930
really ordered the wolves to kill,

289
00:13:07,150 --> 00:13:08,440
even if she is pitiful,

290
00:13:09,200 --> 00:13:10,800
the law will not tolerate it.

291
00:14:47,150 --> 00:14:47,960
Xia Jiuying.

292
00:14:53,910 --> 00:14:54,720
Go away!

293
00:14:55,030 --> 00:14:56,600
I want to be with my mother.

294
00:14:58,000 --> 00:15:00,200
Mother, I will protect you.

295
00:15:00,840 --> 00:15:02,390
That should be her mother.

296
00:15:06,360 --> 00:15:07,150
