and find some good swimmers,

588
00:33:56,920 --> 00:34:00,000
the kind who are good at diving,
holding their breath,

589
00:34:00,110 --> 00:34:01,680
and salvaging underwater.

590
00:34:02,000 --> 00:34:03,060
I will do as you say.

591
00:34:08,280 --> 00:34:09,150
My Lords,

592
00:34:09,150 --> 00:34:10,510
I will take my leave now.

593
00:34:15,360 --> 00:34:16,230
An invitation?

594
00:34:19,760 --> 00:34:21,889
[Respectfully from the Ji Family]

595
00:34:20,110 --> 00:34:21,969
An invitation from the Ji family.

596
00:34:22,110 --> 00:34:23,330
This Ji Ada is quite bold.

597
00:34:23,330 --> 00:34:24,429
We haven't even settled the score with him

598
00:34:24,429 --> 00:34:25,380
for letting his dogs
maul someone to death,

599
00:34:25,380 --> 00:34:26,989
yet he comes to us himself.

600
00:34:28,860 --> 00:34:29,900
Interesting.

601
00:34:30,429 --> 00:34:32,550
The person who delivered
the invitation said

602
00:34:32,550 --> 00:34:33,980
it's to thank the Divine Constable Bureau

603
00:34:33,980 --> 00:34:35,120
for solving the case brilliantly

604
00:34:35,120 --> 00:34:36,030
and successfully catching

605
00:34:36,030 --> 00:34:37,469
Zhe Shan's murderer.

606
00:34:37,489 --> 00:34:40,000
He's holding some kind of
appreciation banquet.

607
00:34:40,000 --> 00:34:40,280
[Invitation]

608
00:34:42,940 --> 00:34:44,850
He's certainly well-informed.

609
00:34:45,330 --> 00:34:47,590
The suspect was just locked up in prison,

610
00:34:47,659 --> 00:34:49,659
and he's already hosting a banquet.

611
00:34:49,679 --> 00:34:51,449
He doesn't even consider

612
00:34:51,480 --> 00:34:52,920
the blood on his hands.

613
00:34:53,110 --> 00:34:54,710
Then what are we waiting for?

614
00:34:54,710 --> 00:34:56,510
Every wrong has its cause,
every debt has its debtor.

615
00:34:56,510 --> 00:34:58,710
Let's just go settle the score with him.

616
00:35:03,600 --> 00:35:04,780
[Invitation]

617
00:35:24,150 --> 00:35:25,150
Please, My Lords.

618
00:35:39,970 --> 00:35:41,960
You truly are Divine Constables
of the Divine Constable Bureau.

619
00:35:41,960 --> 00:35:43,700
You've only been in Mingling
for a few days,

620
00:35:43,700 --> 00:35:45,880
and you've already eliminated
the green-haired demon

621
00:35:45,880 --> 00:35:46,830
and caught

622
00:35:46,850 --> 00:35:48,550
Zhe Shan's murderer.

623
00:35:48,920 --> 00:35:51,510
I am truly impressed.

624
00:35:51,550 --> 00:35:53,920
I have specially prepared
some wine and dishes

625
00:35:53,920 --> 00:35:57,560
to celebrate your success
and welcome you, My Lords.

626
00:35:58,360 --> 00:36:01,070
Come, My Lords, please have a seat.

627
00:36:16,670 --> 00:36:17,670
Lord Yan,

628
00:36:19,150 --> 00:36:20,680
what is the meaning of this?

629
00:36:24,920 --> 00:36:26,840
According to our dynasty's etiquette,

630
00:36:26,840 --> 00:36:28,550
royalty who break the law
do not wear cangues.

631
00:36:28,550 --> 00:36:29,200
Since you are

632
00:36:29,200 --> 00:36:30,790
Princess Ding's cousin,

633
00:36:30,810 --> 00:36:32,600
whether you wear these shackles or not

634
00:36:32,600 --> 00:36:33,640
is up to you.

635
00:36:33,670 --> 00:36:35,860
But for the crimes you have committed,

636
00:36:35,920 --> 00:36:38,250
we will definitely pursue them to the end.

637
00:36:44,610 --> 00:36:46,130
So you are all here

638
00:36:46,160 --> 00:36:47,910
to condemn me.

639
00:36:48,320 --> 00:36:50,380
Then I would like to ask you, My Lords.

640
00:36:50,880 --> 00:36:52,920
What crime have I committed?

641
00:36:53,000 --> 00:36:55,190
Twelve years ago on Mount Fuyao,

642
00:36:56,320 --> 00:36:57,880
you had your dogs attack

643
00:36:57,920 --> 00:37:00,050
and kill someone, and buried the body.

644
00:37:05,560 --> 00:37:06,640
So Xia Jiuying

645
00:37:06,660 --> 00:37:09,120
still managed to piece
her mother together.

646
00:37:09,800 --> 00:37:11,240
This fool.

647
00:37:11,720 --> 00:37:12,800
My Lords,

648
00:37:13,900 --> 00:37:15,220
you don't think

649
00:37:15,250 --> 00:37:17,060
you can convict me with just

650
00:37:17,080 --> 00:37:19,490
a bunch of rotten bones, do you?

651
00:37:19,520 --> 00:37:21,310
Your butler, Huang Bingshui,

652
00:37:21,360 --> 00:37:22,850
is currently at the county office,

653
00:37:22,850 --> 00:37:25,380
having a heart-to-heart
talk with Lord Situ.

654
00:37:25,520 --> 00:37:26,160
Why not

655
00:37:26,190 --> 00:37:27,990
invite them to the Tingchao Boat

656
00:37:28,420 --> 00:37:31,130
and talk while we eat?

657
00:37:31,610 --> 00:37:33,450
Huang Bingshui...

658
00:37:38,510 --> 00:37:39,880
Huang Bingshui

659
00:37:39,900 --> 00:37:41,360
is an ungrateful traitor.

660
00:37:41,360 --> 00:37:43,290
You actually believe what he says?

661
00:37:47,400 --> 00:37:48,910
Back then,

662
00:37:50,150 --> 00:37:52,240
if he hadn't failed to hold on

663
00:37:52,270 --> 00:37:53,540
to that dog...

664
00:37:54,400 --> 00:37:56,660
Now he's turning around and accusing me.

665
00:37:56,730 --> 00:37:57,960
I think

666
00:37:59,110 --> 00:38:00,930
he's worse than a dog!

667
00:38:06,550 --> 00:38:07,780
My Lords.

668
00:38:08,360 --> 00:38:10,900
Wasn't she just a village woman?

669
00:38:11,150 --> 00:38:12,970
Is it worth making you all

670
00:38:13,000 --> 00:38:14,480
go to such great lengths

671
00:38:14,510 --> 00:38:15,970
and ruin your mood?

672
00:38:15,990 --> 00:38:16,870
Why don't we

673
00:38:17,760 --> 00:38:19,170
sit down and drink?

674
00:38:19,550 --> 00:38:21,700
You have no regard for the law whatsoever,

675
00:38:21,700 --> 00:38:22,190
do you?

676
00:38:22,190 --> 00:38:23,190
Lord Yan.

677
00:38:28,510 --> 00:38:30,370
We are here to investigate a case.

678
00:38:30,400 --> 00:38:32,260
Since we are here to investigate,

679
00:38:32,320 --> 00:38:33,800
we must follow the rules.

680
00:38:43,440 --> 00:38:44,510
However,

681
00:38:45,110 --> 00:38:46,880
what Mr. Ji just said

682
00:38:47,280 --> 00:38:48,510
is indeed true.

683
00:38:48,700 --> 00:38:50,160
Even a saint

684
00:38:50,400 --> 00:38:52,150
couldn't tolerate this.

685
00:38:53,190 --> 00:38:54,030
Is that so?

686
00:39:05,920 --> 00:39:07,660
-Li Si, you...
-This slap

687
00:39:07,710 --> 00:39:09,530
is to vent some anger on behalf

688
00:39:09,710 --> 00:39:10,800
of Xia Jiuying and her mother.

689
00:39:10,800 --> 00:39:11,490
You...

690
00:39:21,760 --> 00:39:22,880
This slap

691
00:39:23,360 --> 00:39:25,000
is on behalf of the people

692
00:39:25,150 --> 00:39:26,480
of Mingling County,

693
00:39:26,650 --> 00:39:29,110
for your cruelty and
for running a Hound Pit.

694
00:39:29,130 --> 00:39:30,360
Lord Li.

695
00:39:30,550 --> 00:39:31,440
Calm down.

696
00:39:31,670 --> 00:39:32,840
Didn't you just say

697
00:39:32,870 --> 00:39:35,670
that we must follow the rules
when handling cases?

698
00:39:43,360 --> 00:39:44,470
Mr. Ji.

699
00:39:44,920 --> 00:39:46,320
Ms. Bai is right.

700
00:39:46,670 --> 00:39:47,720
Just now,

701
00:39:47,800 --> 00:39:49,320
I lost my temper.

702
00:39:49,400 --> 00:39:51,280
Please forgive me.

703
00:39:54,760 --> 00:39:57,030
Men!

704
00:40:02,510 --> 00:40:03,360
Mr. Ji.

705
00:40:06,110 --> 00:40:07,900
Capture them all!

706
00:40:08,360 --> 00:40:09,550
I don't care what bureau you're from.

707
00:40:09,550 --> 00:40:10,920
No authority can help you here.

708
00:40:10,920 --> 00:40:11,710
Today,

709
00:40:11,960 --> 00:40:13,820
none of you will leave here alive!

710
00:40:32,150 --> 00:40:33,250
What do you want?

711
00:40:33,270 --> 00:40:34,160
Where do you think you're going?

712
00:40:34,160 --> 00:40:34,910
Stay away!

713
00:40:34,930 --> 00:40:35,720
Stay away!

714
00:40:35,750 --> 00:40:37,230
Stay away! Stay away!

715
00:40:38,590 --> 00:40:39,500
-Stay away!
-Stop!

716
00:40:39,500 --> 00:40:40,460
Stay away!

717
00:40:40,490 --> 00:40:42,320
The Divine Constable Bureau
is killing people!

718
00:40:42,320 --> 00:40:45,280
The Divine Constable Bureau is killing...

719
00:41:00,910 --> 00:41:04,420
[Ji Mansion]

720
00:41:04,480 --> 00:41:05,280
Second Master!

721
00:41:05,280 --> 00:41:06,590
Bad news! Bad news!

722
00:41:07,510 --> 00:41:08,800
B-Bad news.

723
00:41:08,800 --> 00:41:09,710
Something terrible has happened.

724
00:41:09,710 --> 00:41:11,280
Why are you panicking?

725
00:41:11,760 --> 00:41:12,720
Master, he...

726
00:41:12,920 --> 00:41:14,320
Master fell into the sea!

727
00:41:16,670 --> 00:41:18,010
Has he been rescued?

728
00:41:18,190 --> 00:41:19,320
N-No.

729
00:41:20,360 --> 00:41:21,930
What are you waiting for?

730
00:41:22,150 --> 00:41:23,400
Hurry up and find him.

731
00:41:23,480 --> 00:41:24,710
Yes, yes.

732
00:41:29,510 --> 00:41:30,970
Two of you, move this away.

733
00:41:31,150 --> 00:41:32,140
Okay.

734
00:41:32,170 --> 00:41:33,360
Come, put it here.

735
00:41:35,710 --> 00:41:36,910
This side needs to be cleaned up too.

736
00:41:36,910 --> 00:41:37,720
Okay.

737
00:41:37,800 --> 00:41:38,810
Come, put it here.

738
00:42:09,510 --> 00:42:11,120
Your martial arts have improved.

739
00:42:11,120 --> 00:42:12,710
The rock crumbled like

740
00:42:12,710 --> 00:42:14,240
a block of salt in your hand.

741
00:42:14,590 --> 00:42:15,900
This is a block of salt.

742
00:42:23,710 --> 00:42:24,670
It really is.

743
00:42:27,150 --> 00:42:28,590
Huang Bingshui was right.

744
00:42:28,590 --> 00:42:30,690
The Hound Pit appeared to be
an underground fighting ring,

745
00:42:30,690 --> 00:42:33,950
but it's actually a warehouse
for hiding government salt.

746
00:42:35,510 --> 00:42:36,710
So

747
00:42:36,880 --> 00:42:38,190
this government salt

748
00:42:38,280 --> 00:42:40,320
was usually right under our feet.

749
00:42:41,480 --> 00:42:43,360
But making so much salt

750
00:42:43,800 --> 00:42:44,710
must have required

751
00:42:44,710 --> 00:42:46,230
a massive salt pan.

752
00:42:46,400 --> 00:42:48,190
Did no one find out?

753
00:42:49,550 --> 00:42:50,630
This salt

754
00:42:50,710 --> 00:42:53,360
may not have been made
by the Ji family themselves.

755
00:42:53,360 --> 00:42:54,280
Don't forget

756
00:42:54,590 --> 00:42:56,000
what the Gong family

757
00:42:56,320 --> 00:42:57,720
of Mingling County does.

758
00:42:58,360 --> 00:43:00,070
Transporting government salt.

759
00:43:00,070 --> 00:43:01,510
They're embezzling imperial property.

760
00:43:01,510 --> 00:43:03,080
What Gong Le told us that day

761
00:43:03,100 --> 00:43:04,690
about the Gong family
selling government salt

762
00:43:04,690 --> 00:43:06,330
seems to be true now.

763
00:43:07,880 --> 00:43:09,600
But aren't the Gong family
and the Ji family

764
00:43:09,600 --> 00:43:11,540
sworn enemies?

765
00:43:12,110 --> 00:43:13,880
How could they collude?

766
00:43:14,180 --> 00:43:15,100
My Lords.

767
00:43:17,880 --> 00:43:18,800
My Lords.

768
00:43:18,920 --> 00:43:20,230
Have you found Ji Ada?

769
00:43:20,360 --> 00:43:21,230
Not yet.

770
00:43:21,360 --> 00:43:22,600
These past few days, our men

771
00:43:22,600 --> 00:43:24,250
have searched all the nearby beaches

772
00:43:24,250 --> 00:43:26,050
and haven't found Ji Ada's body.

773
00:43:26,360 --> 00:43:27,960
Lord Situ asked me to come and ask

774
00:43:27,960 --> 00:43:30,570
if we should keep searching.
